ci.yml runs gofmt, vet and builds but never the test suite; release.yml has no test step either.
Real tests exist (file tools, script placement, MCP handshake, supervisor lifecycle) and none of them gate a merge to main.
Acceptance: ci.yml runs the suite with -count=1; release.yml runs it before the build so a tag cannot ship an untested binary; both stay offline on vendored deps.
